    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c95008d0b706b6c78e66f4d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『历史证明，她最终会成为获得重赏的杰出人物。\n故事将从新年最初的东京赛场开始（撰稿人C）』",
      "source_fingerprint": "b776f86e5a1a7dae699b541acc8a7adb8391698c47465f0a63bb87089c7c1d86",
